---
description: Vertical slices, TDD for behavior, tidy-refactor only when green
alwaysApply: true
---

# Slices & TDD

- Behavior changes go through `tdd` (red → green → refactor).
- One vertical slice at a time; no “boiling the ocean” PRs.
- After green, prefer `tidy-refactor` before starting the next ticket’s new behavior.
- Do not mix new features into a tidy/refactor pass.
